(1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY) Tj T*
(At approximately 03:15 AM on October 13, 2024, Meridian Tech automated) Tj T*
(intrusion alarms alerted security operations to an unauthorized bulk database) Tj T*
(export from the core customer relational database in Server Room B.) Tj T*
(Approximately 450,000 sensitive customer identity and billing records were) Tj T*
(extracted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. TIMELINE OF INCIDENT) Tj T*
(- 2024-10-12 21:00:00 - Routine shift handover in Building 4.) Tj T*
(- 2024-10-12 22:14:30 - Physical entry recorded at Server Room B.) Tj T*
(- 2024-10-12 22:18:00 - Database administrative session initiated on Console) Tj T*
(2.) Tj T*
(- 2024-10-12 22:31:00 - Data extraction command executed.) Tj T*
(- 2024-10-12 22:38:00 - Session terminated; console logged off.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. PHYSICAL ACCESS OBSERVATIONS) Tj T*
(Facilities Maintenance initial report stated the magnetic door lock on Server) Tj T*
(Room B was fully engaged and secured during the 10:00 PM security patrol.) Tj T*
(However, physical evidence recovered on October 13 indicates security) Tj T*
(mechanisms were tampered with prior to the intrusion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. PRELIMINARY IMPACT) Tj T*
(Customer privacy records compromise poses extreme legal and reputational) Tj T*
(liability. Immediate isolation of Building 4 server infrastructure was ordered) Tj T*
